From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:23:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Decompile bomb loading, the bomb circle and all
 three Reimu bombs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Code following an `if(…) continue;` starts at a jump label, which resets
TCC's knowledge of register contents; sub_E2D9() relies on that to push SI
instead of AX.
---
 Tupfile.lua                   |    1 +
 th02/main/player/bomb.hpp     |    2 +-
 th02/main/player/bombanim.cpp |  534 +++++++++++++
 th02_main.asm                 | 1325 ++-------------------------------
 4 files changed, 583 insertions(+), 1279 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 th02/main/player/bombanim.cpp

